From 6d0dff5d90e62058861b6d99795cf7b90464499d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antonio Borneo <antonio.borneo@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Oct 2025 14:59:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: configs: add stm32mp_defconfig fragments

Drop from stm32mp_defconfig all the architecture except ARCH_STM32.
This prevents such compile flags to turn on other compile flags
not relevant for ARCH_STM32.
This also helps highlighting the dependencies required by
ARCH_STM32 that were enabled by the other machines.

Add the fragments to further filter the configuration.

Signed-off-by: Antonio Borneo <antonio.borneo@foss.st.com>
